<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies eight issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies eight issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said it has qualified for bond insurance the following eight issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Saco, Maine, $2 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--South Haven, Mich., $2.2 million electric revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Madison, Miss., $1 million public improvement GOs.</p>
<p>--Tupelo, Miss., $1.6 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Chatham County, N.C., $5.435 million GOs and $14 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Hannibal CSD, N.Y., $3.3 million school district bonds.</p>
<p>--Round Rock, ISD, Texas, $4.980 million public improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650.</p>
</text>
